                                    <task type="Show Message Box" id="4" taskOnFail="false" >
                                        <data value="Syranna's Personal Log" name="journalEntryTitle" />
                                        <data value="&quot;You input Syranna's access code and begin sifting through her files. You find records of Arani Koden instructing Syranna to begin co-ordinating supply runs to the Rebel Alliance and Syranna's protests. Heedless of her assistant's objections, Korden ordered Syranna to proceed with the supply runs and threatened to fire her if she refused to do so. You also find several records detailing the location of supply and weapons caches delivered to the Rebellion and a list of Rebel contacts that Korden has cultivated over the years. These files have given you all the evidence you need to expose Arani's actions to her father. Head to one of the city's public holo terminals and transmit the data to Tavin Korden.&quot;" name="journalEntryDescription" />
